@@ -1,5 +1,13 @@
 # UnderWeb X changelog
 
+## 0.5.7-rc16 — Staff tools: undo, dashboard, notes, Discord alerts, recruiting stats
+
+- **Undo**: Ban and Remove wait 10 seconds with an Undo button (in the pop-up and at the top of the Groups tab) before anything is sent to VRChat. Undone actions are logged as "undone". Unban runs right away.
+- **Saved invite setups** (Invites → Instance invites): one click switches who to invite and which message; the ➤ button switches and invites in one go. "Save current" stores what you have set.
+- **Staff & recruiting** (Groups, per group): unusual activity to look at (bursts of bans/removals, role permission changes, big group changes), staff activity table, and recruiting — group invites sent, how many of those people joined within 2 weeks, by who invited and by Event Mode event.
+- **History & notes** on any member you look up: first join, past bans/removals/kicks/warnings, their label if any, the group log about them, and private staff notes kept on this PC.
+- **Discord alerts**: paste a webhook from a private staff channel and pick a group. UWX checks every 2 minutes in the background and posts bans/removals/kicks/warnings, role changes, unusual activity and Event Mode recaps (each can be turned off). Optional: a heads-up when a labeled person is in an instance with you — names only, never where. Connecting doesn't dump old history; nobody gets pinged.
+
 ## 0.5.6-rc15 — Bad news labels (synced) + UnderWeb sign-in
 
 - **Lobby Guard**: everyone in your instance is checked automatically against the shared, staff-reviewed labels (crashers, doxxers, malicious clients, harassers, scammers, ban evaders…) as they join. You get a private pop-up; nobody is kicked, blocked or told. Choose every label / caution and up / high risk only, or turn it off. Only VRChat user IDs are looked up.
